		// the pinned store is ACCEPTED on condition the run REFUSES by name if any re-forged base id differs — the runner's -verify
		// asserts it from the log: pesc260805 and sif cannot name a version without forging and ARE re-forged every run; ceds and
		// edfi are reused). <line> ∈ rejudgeDebug | materialise | materialiseReal; <phase> a run token. The runner
		// apps/graph-builder/test/bridgeAcceptance/runBridgeAcceptanceCommand.js reproduces the line token for token.
